  "description": "The sweet spot between racing, bikepacking, commuting and everything else in between, the RUUT should be chosen by anyone who expects their bike to cover a vast range of applications. What makes the RUUT exceptionally versatile is the unique TwinTip fork – a feature that allows you to fine tune the handling and set up your bike exactly the way you like – more relaxed or more racy, the choice is yours to make at any point in time. The RUUT has always been one step ahead of its time, and the third generation of the aluminum version is no exception. The pinnacle of frame design excellence, it features a seamless integration of the bottom bracket and seat tube, and a hidden toolbox located on the underbody of the frame which contains a special mini tool. The unique design offers generous tire clearance and room for large chainrings.\n\nToolbox: Nestled on the underside of the frame, the toolbox contains a special mini-tool, a chain breaker and space for chain links. Downright handy: The tools can be pulled out one-handed by simply opening a rubber flap and pulling it out with one finger. The toolbox can be easily unscrewed and thus gives easy access to the bottom bracket region, making cable routing a breeze.\n\nThe RUUT AL1 TEAL delivers exceptional value with its SRAM APEX XPLR 1x12 drivetrain, SRAM XPLR D1 11–44 cassette, and factory-built reliable WTB wheels and WTB tires. Perfect for riders seeking reliability and versatility without compromising on quality.",
